   LIGHT MODEL for default
     ground      #fafafa → read as light
     position    above and slightly left (x -8%, y -100%)
     temperature --ds-light-temp
     strategy    raise with SHADOW — the cast shadow does the work
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
